# design-system

- Prefix `app`. Standalone, `OnPush`, `input()` / `output()`.
- Styles: `@use 'ds' as ds;` + `var(--app-*)` only — no hex/rgb/raw px.
- Prefer native element + attribute selector when semantics matter (`button[app-button]`).
- Export new public symbols from `ui` / `icons` / `layout` / `tokens` `src/index.ts`.
- Public `type` / `interface` / variant constants live in sibling `*.types.ts` (not inside `*.component.ts`); re-export via `index.ts`.
- No feature business logic or feature i18n product copy inside DS — accept label inputs.
- Add a Storybook `*.stories.ts` for new UI components.
- Do not duplicate existing primitives (button, table, form field, toast, …).
- **Vendor-free:** never import `@taiga-ui/*` or `@ionic/*` here. Wrappers → `@senbilan/vendors/ui`.
